type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123920","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123920.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123920.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->ChatGPT helped me understand the existing code and suggested exempting Linear mode from the early return when prev_key == next_key. I applied the change and verified the result in the editor.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122626\r\n\r\nWhen the first key was created in Linear mode, its handles kept the default values of -0.25 and 0.25. In Linear mode, both handles should instead be set to (0, 0).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nbezier_track_calculate_handles() returned early when prev_key == next_key, which happens when the track contains only one key. This prevented the Linear mode calculation from setting the first key's handles to (0, 0). The change makes Linear mode an exception to that early return.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"ScreenShot#122626\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faf0b9c2-e38e-4c78-aa17-4f0a5b105d1f\" />\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123920/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}